<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">AC &#8211; Audit Committee<br>
C &#8211; Committee Chair</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">CC &#8211; Compensation Committee</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">NGC &#8211; Nominating and Governance Committee</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">M &#8211; Committee Member</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

<div class="PGBK" style="width: 100%; margin-left: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt">
