			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:34%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">President and Chief Commercial Officer</p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:11.5%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">David Steigelfest</p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:8%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">55</p>
			</td>
