<p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 6pt; text-indent: 39pt; text-align: justify;">IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the Company, by its duly authorized officer, has executed this Amendment to the Super League Gaming, Inc. Amended and Restated 2014 Stock Option and Incentive Plan, as of the date first indicated above.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

